Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:39.29,Hook,,0,0,0,,CREÍ QUE ERA UN BAR
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Creí que esto era un bar.\NCreí que era un bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.54,0:00:06.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No, no me voy a llevar\Nnada. Solo no llames a\Nla...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:07.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}...policía, por favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:10.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ah, carajo. ¡Ven!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:12.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Te...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:16.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}...robaste la cerveza?\N¡Puta, Lucía!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:18.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No, se dieron cuenta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:22.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Esta no es mi camioneta,\Ncarajo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:24.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}La...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.66,0:00:27.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}...mataron. Dios.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.71,0:00:32.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Terrible juego.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.71,0:00:35.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Te valieron. Te\Nvalieron...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.81,0:00:37.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}...y nunca botó el six\Npack...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.43,0:00:39.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}...de chelas.
